  "title": "NMF: Prevent overflow in nmf_get_pdu_len",
  "description": "Take a subset to reduce overflow. Use an unsigned offset starting at\nzero, since that's what get_pdu_len functions return. Test for\noverflow when adding a length. We don't right now distinguish between\n\"illegally large value\" (size > UINT32_MAX) and \"legal but very large\nvalue that overflows a 32-bit unsigned and thus we can't handle.\"\n\nOSS-Fuzz Issue 472635037\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
